{"slug":"/students/subjects/biology/genetics/variation-evolution/","source":"students/subjects/biology/genetics/variation-evolution.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Variation & Evolution | Biology","description":"","subject":"biology","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n        <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/genetics/\" class=\"text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700\">← Back to Genetics &amp; Evolution</a>\n        </nav>\n        \n        <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n            <header class=\"mb-8\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Variation &amp; Evolution</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">Understanding how species adapt and change over time</p>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n                <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Learning Objectives</h2>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>• Understand sources of variation in populations</li>\n                        <li>• Explain natural selection and adaptation</li>\n                        <li>• Analyze how species change over time</li>\n                        <li>• Describe evidence for evolution</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Video Content -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Video Lessons</h2>\n                    <div class=\"aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9 mb-4\">\n                        <iframe title=\"Evolution Overview\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"w-full h-[400px] rounded-lg\"></iframe>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 1: Sources of Variation</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Genetic and environmental factors</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 2: Natural Selection</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">How evolution works in nature</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Key Concepts -->\n                <section class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Key Concepts</h2>\n                    \n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Variation in Populations</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Sources of variation:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Genetic factors</li>\n                                    <li>- Environmental factors</li>\n                                    <li>- Gene combinations</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Types of variation:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Continuous variation</li>\n                                    <li>- Discontinuous variation</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Population characteristics:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Gene pools</li>\n                                    <li>- Allele frequencies</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Natural Selection</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Darwin's observations:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Overproduction</li>\n                                    <li>- Competition</li>\n                                    <li>- Survival advantages</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Selection process:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Environmental pressures</li>\n                                    <li>- Differential survival</li>\n                                    <li>- Reproductive success</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Types of selection:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Directional selection</li>\n                                    <li>- Stabilizing selection</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Adaptation</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Physical adaptations:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Body structures</li>\n                                    <li>- Coloration</li>\n                                    <li>- Size and shape</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Behavioral adaptations:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Feeding strategies</li>\n                                    <li>- Mating behaviors</li>\n                                    <li>- Migration patterns</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Environmental fit:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Habitat requirements</li>\n                                    <li>- Resource use</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">4. Evidence for Evolution</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Observable evidence:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Fossil record</li>\n                                    <li>- Similar structures</li>\n                                    <li>- Shared features</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Modern examples:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Antibiotic resistance</li>\n                                    <li>- Pesticide resistance</li>\n                                    <li>- Industrial melanism</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Practical Activities -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Practical Activities</h2>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Variation Studies</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Measuring variation</li>\n                                <li>• Population sampling</li>\n                                <li>• Data analysis</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Adaptation Analysis</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Feature comparisons</li>\n                                <li>• Habitat studies</li>\n                                <li>• Case study reviews</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Assessment Questions -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Self-Assessment</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Explain how variation arises in populations.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Include both genetic and environmental factors.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Describe how natural selection leads to evolution.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Use a specific example from nature.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Analyze different types of adaptations.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Compare physical and behavioral adaptations.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        .content-card {\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}